{"seq":15,"slug":"site-reliability-engineering","title":"站点可靠性工程","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"站点可靠性工程\">站点可靠性工程</h1><p>我们每天依赖的数字服务——搜索、支付、社交、视频——必须时刻可用、稳定可靠。可是，这些由海量机器、复杂软件构成的系统，本就充满了故障与不确定：机器会宕机、网络会中断、软件会出错、流量会激增。如何让如此庞大、复杂、易错的系统，依然稳定可靠地运行、近乎永不停机？这正是站点可靠性工程（Site Reliability Engineering, SRE）所要回答的问题。SRE 是一种用软件工程的方法来解决运维问题、保障大规模系统可靠运行的学科，已成为现代基础设施运维的主流范式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定位与核心价值\">定位与核心价值</h2><p>本知识库面向希望理解大规模系统如何稳定运行的读者，无需深厚的运维背景，系统讲解 SRE 从核心理念到工程实践的完整脉络。学完本 hub，读者将能理解：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SRE 如何用&quot;量化可靠性&quot;取代&quot;凭感觉判断系统好不好&quot;</li>\n<li>错误预算为何能巧妙平衡&quot;保障可靠&quot;与&quot;快速创新&quot;这对根本张力</li>\n<li>琐务（toil）为何是规模化的大敌，自动化如何解放工程师</li>\n<li>故障响应与无指责复盘如何让系统从每次故障中变得更强</li>\n<li>监控、容量规划、发布工程等实践如何共同构成可靠性的防线</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[第一章&lt;br&gt;基础与核心理念] --&gt; B[第二章&lt;br&gt;服务水平目标与错误预算]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第三章&lt;br&gt;消除琐务]&#10;    C --&gt; D[第四章&lt;br&gt;事件响应与复盘]&#10;    D --&gt; E[第五章&lt;br&gt;工程实践与意义]\">graph LR\n    A[第一章&lt;br&gt;基础与核心理念] --&gt; B[第二章&lt;br&gt;服务水平目标与错误预算]\n    B --&gt; C[第三章&lt;br&gt;消除琐务]\n    C --&gt; D[第四章&lt;br&gt;事件响应与复盘]\n    D --&gt; E[第五章&lt;br&gt;工程实践与意义]</pre><p><strong>第一章 基础与核心理念</strong> 阐明 SRE 的含义——用软件工程方法解决运维问题——核心理念（量化可靠性、错误预算、消除琐务、从故障学习），以及它要解决的关键问题。建立对 SRE 的整体认知。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 服务水平目标与错误预算</strong> 深入 SRE 最核心的思想。用服务水平指标（SLI）与目标（SLO）量化可靠性，并用&quot;错误预算&quot;这一精妙机制巧妙地平衡&quot;保障可靠&quot;与&quot;快速创新&quot;这对始终存在的张力。这是 SRE 区别于传统运维的思想内核。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 消除琐务</strong> 讲解什么是&quot;琐务&quot;——重复的手工运维劳作——它的深重危害（无法规模化、挤占工程时间、损害士气），以及如何通过系统化的自动化策略把人从琐务中解放出来，让工程师投入真正创造价值的工作。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 事件响应与复盘</strong> 考察如何高效有序地应对不可避免的故障事件，以及如何通过&quot;无指责的复盘&quot;（blameless postmortem）真正地从故障中学习、持续改进系统的韧性。</p>\n<p><strong>第五章 工程实践与意义</strong> 介绍系统保障可靠性的具体实践——监控与告警、容量规划、发布工程、为故障而设计（Design for Failure）——并总览 SRE 对运维的变革及其所代表的工程文化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阅读建议\">阅读建议</h2><p>建议按章节顺序阅读。第一章建立整体认知，第二章把握 SRE 最核心的思想（错误预算），第三、四章理解消除琐务与从故障学习这两大实践，第五章掌握保障可靠的工程实践并上升到文化与意义。阅读时不妨始终把握一条主线：站点可靠性工程，用软件工程的方法保障大规模系统可靠运行——它以量化可靠性、用错误预算平衡可靠与创新、消除琐务、从故障中学习、为故障而设计等理念与实践，把运维从手工的救火，转变为工程化、数据驱动、可持续的可靠性保障学科。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与核心理念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-sre","title":"什么是站点可靠性工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/foundations/what-is-sre"},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-philosophy","title":"SRE 的核心理念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/foundations/core-philosophy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"key-problems","title":"SRE 要解决的关键问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/foundations/key-problems"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"slo-error-budget","title":"服务水平目标与错误预算","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/slo-error-budget","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sli-and-slo","title":"服务水平指标与目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/slo-error-budget/sli-and-slo"},{"seq":2,"slug":"error-budget","title":"错误预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/slo-error-budget/error-budget"},{"seq":3,"slug":"balancing-reliability-innovation","title":"用错误预算平衡可靠与创新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/slo-error-budget/balancing-reliability-innovation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"setting-good-targets","title":"设定恰当的可靠性目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/slo-error-budget/setting-good-targets"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"eliminating-toil","title":"消除琐务","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/eliminating-toil","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-toil","title":"什么是琐务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/eliminating-toil/what-is-toil"},{"seq":2,"slug":"harms-of-toil","title":"琐务的危害","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/eliminating-toil/harms-of-toil"},{"seq":3,"slug":"automation","title":"用自动化消除琐务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/eliminating-toil/automation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"incident-response","title":"事件响应与复盘","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/incident-response","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"incident-response","title":"事件响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/incident-response/incident-response"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blameless-postmortem","title":"无指责的事后复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/incident-response/blameless-postmortem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"learning-from-failure","title":"从故障中学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/incident-response/learning-from-failure"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"practices-and-significance","title":"工程实践与意义","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/practices-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monitoring-capacity-release","title":"监控、容量规划与发布工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/practices-and-significance/monitoring-capacity-release"},{"seq":2,"slug":"design-for-failure","title":"为故障而设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/practices-and-significance/design-for-failure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"significance-and-culture","title":"意义与文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/site-reliability-engineering/practices-and-significance/significance-and-culture"}]}]}